## Getting the per-site rows

They are not published, and this repository cannot license them to you. Ask
UNEP-WCMC directly — **protectedareas@unep-wcmc.org** — and download the same
release from protectedplanet.net, which is where these came from. Every capture
is named in `SOURCES.md` and the manifest records the byte count and SHA-256 of
each one, so you can verify you have the same file this archive holds.

If you want to publish a derived work of your own, the written-permission route
is the same address.
